<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '雅黑, Arial', padding: 60, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 52, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 8, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>08</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>两种落点，三种资料来源</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>存资料 · 入口</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 12, marginBottom: 28 }} />

  <Box style={{ height: 507, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 200, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 200, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 8, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>A</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>松在「存入」</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>界面写「存进这个知识库 · 同事都能搜到」。文件进入待存入清单，等你确认后点「存入」。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E40AF' }}>结果：写进知识库，长期可检索</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 200, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 32, borderRadius: 8, background: '#F59E0B', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>B</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>松在「就问这一次」</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>界面写「用它回答我 · 不入库」。文件变成本次提问的临时附件，答完自动撤掉，换会话即失效。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B45309' }}>结果：不写进库，界面标注 24 小时后失效</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 190, marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 320, height: 190, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>选文件</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>打开系统文件对话框，可一次多选。选完同样只是进清单。</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 6, width: 60, background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 8 }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 190, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>选文件夹</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>选整个目录，会递归收里面的文件；目录层级最多 8 层。</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 6, width: 60, background: '#06B6D4', borderRadius: 8 }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 420, height: 190, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>写一段文字</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>弹窗填标题和内容，支持 Markdown，点「加入待存入」进清单。</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 6, width: 60, background: '#F59E0B', borderRadius: 8 }} />
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 71, marginTop: 22, background: '#1E293B', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0px 24px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 40, background: '#F59E0B', borderRadius: 8 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginLeft: 20 }}>文字笔记同步提交；文件走异步队列，两者分开播报</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, right: 0, bottom: 30, padding: '0px 60px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>知识小助 · 桌宠使用说明</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>08 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
